    "created_at": "2017-08-08T15:02:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-08-08T15:02:34Z",
    "body": "So would it be good to partially revert 03657b3556018de1675c58f7fbc5e51ac2602dfb now that we have a check in \"update steps\" or is that still fine as-is?\r\n\r\nAlso, we should maybe add the note\r\n\r\n    <p class=\"note no-backref\">The <a>update steps</a> are not always run for {{DOMTokenList/toggle()}} for web compatibility.\r\n\r\nhere too? Or generalize it somehow?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
